# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler"
msgstr "Transpiler"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler {#transpiler}"
msgstr "Transpiler {#transpiler}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") function is a flexible and convenient tool to build a [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) that can group the circuit instructions into annotated boxes. This gives an easy alternative to manually grouping and annotating circuits, and is useful for automating a workflow, testing different circuit boxing strategies, and so on.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") adalah alat yang fleksibel dan praktis untuk membangun [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) yang bisa mengelompokkan instruksi circuit ke dalam box beranotasi. Ini menjadi alternatif mudah untuk mengelompokkan dan menganotasi circuit secara manual, dan berguna untuk mengotomatiskan workflow, menguji berbagai strategi boxing circuit, dan sebagainya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide illustrates how to use [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") and its arguments. To highlight the effects of each of the function’s arguments, the following sections mainly refer to the circuit below.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini mengilustrasikan cara memakai [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") beserta argumennya. Untuk menyoroti efek tiap argumen fungsi, bagian-bagian berikut terutama merujuk ke circuit di bawah.\n"

