#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/fe943b034588a5354a87abcf51b8d805c36f4f2b30a73a39c5886bce9e156b04.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/fe943b034588a5354a87abcf51b8d805c36f4f2b30a73a39c5886bce9e156b04.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/fe943b034588a5354a87abcf51b8d805c36f4f2b30a73a39c5886bce9e156b04.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/fe943b034588a5354a87abcf51b8d805c36f4f2b30a73a39c5886bce9e156b04.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pattern also combines naturally with the barrier-based ISA boxing workflow. The boxing pass manager runs as a post-scheduling step, after barriers from the original logical circuit have survived transpilation, so they guide stratification as expected.\n"
msgstr "Pola ini juga cocok digabungkan dengan alur kerja boxing ISA berbasis barrier. Boxing pass manager berjalan sebagai langkah pasca-penjadwalan, setelah barrier dari circuit logis asli bertahan melewati transpilasi, sehingga barrier tersebut memandu stratifikasi sesuai harapan.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/4905bf1df63cc83fa581ed006a93beb709be504a4f59fc7f663f4efde62da175.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/4905bf1df63cc83fa581ed006a93beb709be504a4f59fc7f663f4efde62da175.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/4905bf1df63cc83fa581ed006a93beb709be504a4f59fc7f663f4efde62da175.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/4905bf1df63cc83fa581ed006a93beb709be504a4f59fc7f663f4efde62da175.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect and modify annotations {#inspect-and-modify-annotations}"
msgstr "Memeriksa dan memodifikasi anotasi {#inspect-and-modify-annotations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After auto-boxing, you might want to inspect the annotations on specific boxes or adjust them. For example, to add noise injection, remove annotations, or change a twirling group. Samplomatic provides a set of utility functions in [`samplomatic.utils`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/utils#module-samplomatic.utils \"samplomatic.utils\") for this purpose. All of them return a **new circuit** without modifying the original.\n"
msgstr "Setelah auto-boxing, kamu mungkin ingin memeriksa anotasi pada box tertentu atau menyesuaikannya. Misalnya, untuk menambahkan injeksi noise, menghapus anotasi, atau mengubah grup twirling. Samplomatic menyediakan sejumlah fungsi utilitas di [`samplomatic.utils`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/utils#module-samplomatic.utils \"samplomatic.utils\") untuk keperluan ini. Semuanya mengembalikan **circuit baru** tanpa mengubah yang asli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`extend_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-extend-annotations#samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations\") appends one or more annotations to every box in the circuit.\n"
msgstr "[`extend_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-extend-annotations#samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations\") menambahkan satu atau beberapa anotasi ke setiap box di circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`filter_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-filter-annotations#samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations\") keeps only annotations of specified types, removing the rest. [`replace_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-replace-annotations#samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations\") applies a callable to each annotation; the callable returns a list of annotations to substitute in its place (return `[]` to remove, a single-element list to replace, or a multi-element list to expand).\n"
msgstr "[`filter_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-filter-annotations#samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations\") hanya mempertahankan anotasi dengan tipe tertentu dan membuang sisanya. [`replace_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-replace-annotations#samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations\") menerapkan sebuah callable ke setiap anotasi; callable tersebut mengembalikan daftar anotasi sebagai penggantinya (kembalikan `[]` untuk menghapus, daftar berelemen tunggal untuk mengganti, atau daftar berelemen banyak untuk memperluas).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The general-purpose [`map_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-map-annotations#samplomatic.utils.map_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.map_annotations\") function accepts any callable that maps a list of annotations to a new list, giving you full control over per-box transformations. [`strip_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-strip-annotations#samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations\") is a convenience wrapper that removes all annotations from every box.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi serbaguna [`map_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-map-annotations#samplomatic.utils.map_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.map_annotations\") menerima callable apa pun yang memetakan daftar anotasi ke daftar baru, sehingga kamu punya kendali penuh atas transformasi per box. [`strip_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-strip-annotations#samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations\") adalah wrapper praktis yang menghapus semua anotasi dari setiap box.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For bulk changes like adding [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") to all gate boxes, the `inject_noise_targets` parameter of [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") is the most concise option. These utilities are useful for selective per-box edits that the pass manager parameters do not cover.\n"
msgstr "Untuk perubahan massal seperti menambahkan [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") ke semua box gate, parameter `inject_noise_targets` dari [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") adalah opsi yang paling ringkas. Utilitas ini berguna untuk edit selektif per box yang tidak dicakup oleh parameter pass manager.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a circuit {#build-a-circuit}"
msgstr "Membangun circuit {#build-a-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every pass manager produced by [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") returns circuits that can be successfully turned into a template/samplex pair by [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\"). For example, the following code calls the [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") function on a circuit produced by a boxing pass manager.\n"
msgstr "Setiap pass manager yang dihasilkan oleh [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") mengembalikan circuit yang bisa diubah dengan sukses menjadi pasangan template/samplex oleh [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\"). Misalnya, kode berikut memanggil fungsi [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pada circuit yang dihasilkan oleh boxing pass manager.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To ensure that any transpiled circuit can be successfully built, the pass managers know how to include additional boxes when they are needed. For example, consider the circuit below, which ends with an unmeasured qubit `0`.\n"
msgstr "Agar circuit hasil transpilasi apa pun bisa dibangun dengan sukses, pass manager tahu cara menyertakan box tambahan saat diperlukan. Misalnya, perhatikan circuit di bawah ini, yang berakhir dengan qubit `0` yang tidak diukur.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drawing left-dressed boxes around the gates and measurements would result in a circuit that has uncollected virtual gates on qubit `0`, and calling [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") on this circuit would result in an error. To avoid this, the pass managers returned by [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") can add right-dressed boxes to act as collectors. For example, in the following code, qubit `0` is terminated by a right-dressed box that picks up the uncollected virtual gate. The single-qubit gates acting on qubit `0` are also placed inside the box in order to minimize the depth of the resulting circuit.\n"
msgstr "Menggambar box left-dressed di sekitar gate dan pengukuran akan menghasilkan circuit dengan virtual gate yang tidak terkumpul pada qubit `0`, dan memanggil [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pada circuit ini akan menimbulkan error. Untuk menghindarinya, pass manager yang dikembalikan oleh [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") bisa menambahkan box right-dressed yang bertindak sebagai pengumpul. Misalnya, pada kode berikut, qubit `0` diakhiri dengan box right-dressed yang menampung virtual gate yang belum terkumpul. Gate single-qubit yang bekerja pada qubit `0` juga ditempatkan di dalam box agar kedalaman circuit hasilnya sekecil mungkin.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/711ee3c014edf6f70ede5dfa849494286e96870b3bd70a2a89f687d83cc5bfc1.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/711ee3c014edf6f70ede5dfa849494286e96870b3bd70a2a89f687d83cc5bfc1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/711ee3c014edf6f70ede5dfa849494286e96870b3bd70a2a89f687d83cc5bfc1.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/711ee3c014edf6f70ede5dfa849494286e96870b3bd70a2a89f687d83cc5bfc1.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In another example, a right-dressed box is added to collect the virtual gates that would otherwise remain uncollected due to the unboxed measurements.\n"
msgstr "Pada contoh lain, sebuah box right-dressed ditambahkan untuk mengumpulkan virtual gate yang kalau tidak akan tetap tidak terkumpul akibat pengukuran yang tidak di-box.\n"

